        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Break bad habit (Alkohol trinken)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Tee trinken)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**改掉坏习惯（喝酒）**\n1. 隐形：将触发因素移出视野。\n2. 让自己变得没有吸引力：意识到负面后果。\n3. 让它变得困难：设置障碍（例如删除应用程序、拔掉插头）。\n4. 使其不令人满意：附加刑罚执行。\n\n**建立一个好习惯（喝茶）**\n1. 使其显而易见：将触发器放置在清晰可见的位置。\n2. 让它有吸引力：将它与你喜欢的东西联系起来。\n3. 让它变得简单：将障碍减少到最低限度（例如只需 2 分钟）。\n4. 让它令人满意：事后立即奖励自己。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**改掉壞習慣（喝酒）**\n1. 隱形：將觸發因素移出視野。\n2. 讓自己變得沒有吸引力：意識到負面後果。\n3. 讓它變得困難：設定障礙（例如刪除應用程式、拔掉插頭）。\n4. 使其不令人滿意：附加刑罰執行。\n\n**建立一個好習慣（喝茶）**\n1. 使其顯而易見：將觸發器放置在清晰可見的位置。\n2. 讓它有吸引力：將它與你喜歡的東西連結起來。\n3. 讓它變得簡單：將障礙減少到最低限度（例如只需 2 分鐘）。\n4. 讓它令人滿意：事後立即獎勵自己。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "trash.binge_streaming.desc" : {
      "comment" : "",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Statt Serien-Marathon: Werde aktiv und nutze deine Freizeit sinnvoll."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Instead of a series marathon: Get active and use your free time wisely."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En lugar de un maratón de series: Ponte activo y usa tu tiempo libre sabiamente."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Au lieu d'un marathon de séries : Deviens actif et utilise ton temps libre à bon escient."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "सीरीज मैराथन की बजाय: सक्रिय रहें और अपने खाली समय का सदुपयोग करें।"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Invece di una maratona di serie: Diventa attivo e usa il tuo tempo libero saggiamente."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "シリーズマラソンの代わりに：活動的になり、自由時間を賢く活用しましょう。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "시리즈 마라톤 대신: 적극적으로 자유 시간을 현명하게 활용하세요."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In plaats van een seriemarathon: Word actief en besteed je vrije tijd verstandig."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zamiast maratonu seriali: Bądź aktywny i mądrze wykorzystuj wolny czas."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
