    "trash.energy_drink_kiste.tips" : {
      "comment" : "",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Schlechte Gewohnheit loswerden (Energy Drinks)**\n1. Unsichtbar machen: Entferne die Auslöser aus deinem Sichtfeld.\n2. Unattraktiv machen: Mache dir die negativen Folgen bewusst.\n3. Schwierig machen: Baue Hürden ein (z.B. Apps löschen, Stecker ziehen).\n4. Unbefriedigend machen: Verbinde die Ausführung mit einer Strafe.\n\n**Gute Gewohnheit etablieren (Wasser trinken)**\n1. Offensichtlich machen: Platziere den Auslöser gut sichtbar.\n2. Attraktiv machen: Verbinde es mit etwas, das du magst.\n3. Einfach machen: Reduziere die Hürden auf ein Minimum (z.B. nur 2 Minuten).\n4. Befriedigend machen: Belohne dich direkt im Anschluss."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Break bad habit (Energy Drinks)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Wasser trinken)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Break bad habit (Energy Drinks)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Wasser trinken)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Break bad habit (Energy Drinks)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Wasser trinken)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**खराब आदत से छुटकारा पाएं (Energy Drinks)**\n1. अदृश्य बनाएं: अपने नज़र के सामने ट्रिगर्स हटा दें।\n2. अप्रिय बनाएं: नकारात्मक परिणामों को जानें।\n3. मुश्किल बनाएं: बाधाएँ डालें (जैसे, ऐप्स हटाएँ, प्लग निकालें)।\n4. असंतोषजनक बनाएं: कार्य को किसी सजा के साथ जोड़ें।\n\n**अच्छी आदत स्थापित करें (पानी पीना)**\n1. स्पष्ट बनाएं: ट्रिगर को आसानी से दिखाई देने वाली जगह पर रखें।\n2. आकर्षक बनाएं: इसे किसी ऐसी चीज़ के साथ जोड़ें जिसे आप पसंद करते हैं।\n3. आसान बनाएं: बाधाओं को न्यूनतम पर लाएँ (जैसे, केवल 2 मिनट)।\n4. संतोषजनक बनाएं: तुरंत बाद खुद को इनाम दें।"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Break bad habit (Energy Drinks)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Wasser trinken)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Break bad habit (Energy Drinks)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Wasser trinken)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Break bad habit (Energy Drinks)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Wasser trinken)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Break bad habit (Energy Drinks)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Wasser trinken)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Break bad habit (Energy Drinks)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Wasser trinken)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Break bad habit (Energy Drinks)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Wasser trinken)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Избавьтесь от вредной привычки (энергетические напитки)**\n1. Сделайте невидимыми: уберите триггеры из поля зрения. \n2. Сделайте себя непривлекательным. Помните о негативных последствиях. \n3. Усложните задачу: установите препятствия (например, удалите приложения, отключите их от сети). \n4. Сделайте его неудовлетворительным: прикрепите исполнение к наказанию. \n\n**Выработайте хорошую привычку (пить воду)**\n1. Сделайте это очевидным: разместите триггер на видном месте. \n2. Сделайте это привлекательным. Свяжите это с чем-то, что вам нравится. \n3. Сделайте это просто: сократите препятствия до минимума (например, всего 2 минуты). \n4. Сделайте это приятным: вознаградите себя сразу после этого."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Break bad habit (Energy Drinks)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Wasser trinken)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**改掉坏习惯（能量饮料）**\n1. 隐形：将触发因素移出视野。\n2. 让自己变得没有吸引力：意识到负面后果。\n3. 让它变得困难：设置障碍（例如删除应用程序、拔掉插头）。\n4. 使其不令人满意：附加刑罚执行。\n\n**建立良好的习惯（喝水）**\n1. 使其显而易见：将触发器放置在清晰可见的位置。\n2. 让它有吸引力：将它与你喜欢的东西联系起来。\n3. 让它变得简单：将障碍减少到最低限度（例如只需 2 分钟）。\n4. 让它令人满意：事后立即奖励自己。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**改掉壞習慣（能量飲料）**\n1. 隱形：將觸發因素移出視野。\n2. 讓自己變得沒有吸引力：意識到負面後果。\n3. 讓它變得困難：設定障礙（例如刪除應用程式、拔掉插頭）。\n4. 使其不令人滿意：附加刑罰執行。\n\n**建立良好的習慣（喝水）**\n1. 使其顯而易見：將觸發器放置在清晰可見的位置。\n2. 讓它有吸引力：將它與你喜歡的東西連結起來。\n3. 讓它變得簡單：將障礙減少到最低限度（例如只需 2 分鐘）。\n4. 讓它令人滿意：事後立即獎勵自己。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "trash.fast_food_abo.desc" : {
      "comment" : "",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verzichte auf Fast-Food, koche selbst und ernähre dich gesünder."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Skip fast food, cook for yourself and eat healthier."
          }
        },
